  "checks": [
    "Four widths: no overlap, clipping or page overflow; missing costs hidden; one error and one retry; desktop timestamps reveal on hover/focus",
    "Incremental HTTP SSE at all widths; manual scroll preserved; stop aborts and leaves a single inline error; jump-to-latest works",
    "Search, provider filtering by text, keyboard selection/Escape/focus; no fabricated model metadata; confirmation focus trap; send, real fixture usage, model change mid-chat, copy, rename, regenerate, manual conversion; message delete preserves project copy; menu keyboard/focus; chat delete/undo/8s purge preserves project",
    "Retry of older failed response replaces only that response and preserves later messages",
    "Mobile drawer focus/Escape; touch metadata; reduced-motion messages and portals; multi-line composer at keyboard-sized viewport",
    "An actual SSE error produces one inline error with one retry and no duplicate banner",
    "Catalog loading, empty and 503 error: disabled sending, one recovery action and successful refetch; desktop/mobile history search, composing Escape, Escape closes search before drawer, focus returns, aria-expanded and independent refs after drawer unmount",
    "Keyboard scrolls the focused conversation with PageUp and a visible ring; portaled action menu Escape closes only the menu before the drawer",
    "Multi-provider local fixture at 1280x900, 390x900 and 390x480: rail geometry, Auto, actual descriptions, fallback provider, cross-provider search, left/right and whitespace, IME, active versus selected, activedescendant, pointer focus, Tab/Shift+Tab, Escape, selected provider on reopening, bounds, touch help, reduced motion and axe"
